# Rules for changing this repo

Follow `AGENTS.md` in the repo root. In short:
- Read README §1–§3 first, and follow the design rules R1–R11.
- Keep to one concern per PR.
- Update README.md in the same PR.
- Validate agent changes on real data.
- Fill in the `README:` / `Design rules:` / `Validated:` lines of the PR template.

`pr-checks.yml` enforces these rules.
